# Playwright output
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Wayfinding: one exploration's working notes, whose life is that exploration and no longer.
# What survives becomes a GitHub issue or a file under docs/specs/ (docs/agents/issue-tracker.md).
.scratch/

# playwright-cli's scratch output: snapshots and console logs it writes beside the repo root
# while capturing evidence on the host (docs/agents/pull-requests.md)
.playwright-cli/

# Commercially published books: kept here for verification, never committed
# (this repository is public, so committing one would be publishing it)
tests/books/commercial/
